kMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TWPEXxn88NbEX8jW31ibicxlibHdoEULvMxNyHrPPR3dynYHVItkoXv4YBA1k9LvV46zSkEMiaMIAEFQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"outline: 0px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible !important;width: 578px !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style='max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;text-align: left;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7QbHn4lH5ibAJ5GZRo8Ba1EviaUTqiceq5diaZdAicB3yXvicS27OA955lAvImibGBwSYu8iaurQWU7xpNNQA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style='max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;text-align: left;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style='max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<strong style=\"letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;text-indent: 8px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n           庄园介绍\n          </span>\n</strong>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<hr style=\"border-style: solid;border-width: 1px 0px 0px;border-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.0980392);transform-origin: 0px 0px;transform: scale(1, 0.5);\"/>\n<p style='max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;text-indent: 8px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          Dionel把他的庄园命名为栎树庄园，是为了致敬至今仍存在在庄园内的几棵老栎树。Dionel已经是Chilito家族的第三代咖农。栎树庄园最高处可达海拔1800米，位于慧兰的皮塔利托镇，从4年前开始生产精品级别的咖啡。\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style='max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;text-indent: 8px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7QbHn4lH5ibAJ5GZRo8Ba1EvhARYFpcFUNzmQ2X4VA8MB0kVr7L6NEIrhQPSxuXhbm23pqqRfiaC9Ng/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"/>\n          Dionel决定改变种植的品种，来试验与传统种植的不同所带来的效益。经附近一位咖农的引导，以增加收入为目的，开始了改善种植和处理的尝试。\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7QbHn4lH5ibAJ5GZRo8Ba1EvX94Vb253DbESXCiapjnz2XZwxYYCicv8TbasER1Mb2wicLa4hGHH9ib5KA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"/>\n<span style=\"font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51);max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;text-indent: 8px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          Dionel和他的妻子还有两个女儿在庄园生活与劳作。他对咖啡进行有选择性的采收，具有严格的标准，并且通过浮选去除病果，之后进行发酵并进行晾晒。庄园的卫生管理十分严格，可以看到“此处禁止饮食及吸烟”等标语，水洗处理使用的水质也十分干净。\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style='max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<br style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style='max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;text-align: center;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          文章内容和图片来自广州咖篮\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<br/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0em;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;caret-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n          更多咖啡豆选购，请关注收藏小程序和淘宝店铺哦～\n         </span>\n<br style=\"outline: 0px;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;caret-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;\">\n          公众号的文章栏目有更多的咖啡信息\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;caret-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n          客服微信：sabh_lt （售前/售后/加群）\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style='white-space: normal;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7Q09FO8svc4MbsT6kYe0icjVt0iafAKEvQb4V0sg5ELeaSJuChicNO6jr9zxGVFVu7wDwt3ibVQgXa5ow/640?wx_fmt=png\" style=\"outline: 0px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible !important;width: 388px !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"display: none;\">\n<mp-style-type data-value=\"10000\">\n</mp-style-type>\n</p>\n</div>",
